    "rest pose, body yaw 0; 7 parts grouped from the drawn bones by geometry (tools/hitbox_specs_from_rigs.py: touching bones merge while the union stays a compact square-footprint box the cubes fill, tiny bones fold into their neighbours, limb chains merge under the rig's cap, lateral slabs are padded for the flap): each part a box fitted",
    "to the drawn cubes of its member bones, sized [max(x extent, z extent), y extent], synced to its largest member bone, the",
    "pivot taken back through MHLib's rotation so the box sits on the drawn segment. Damage 1.0 on every part: the 1.7.10 mob",
